OL,3,GNEWSAEx-NCA officer must repay #1.8m
OL,4,Afor stolen Bitcoin
OL,5,
OL,6,FAfter being involved in an NCA
OL,7,Finvestigation into criminal networks
OL,8,Fselling illegal goods on the dark web,
OL,9,FChowles transferred about half of the
OL,10,FBitcoin seized from a drug trafficker
OL,11,Finto his own accounts.
OL,13,FThe Crown Prosecution Service (CPS)
OL,14,Fsecured a confiscation order earlier
OL,15,Fthat is equal to the value of the 50
OL,16,FBitcoin he stole, which has ballooned
OL,17,Ffrom #60,000 to more than #1.8m.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
